From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Subject: [PATCH] [unit] Test when the SIM driver reports a SIM inserted or
 removed

Builds binder_sim.c with binder_sim_card on a fake radio and counts the
ofono_sim_inserted_notify() calls that card status changes lead to: a
SIM showing up is reported once, taking it out reports it removed, a
blank eUICC (present, no applications) is no SIM, and when an eUICC's
profile is disabled (present, applications gone) the SIM is reported
removed, and inserted again once a profile is enabled.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 unit/Makefile            |   1 +
 unit/unit_sim/Makefile   |   7 +
 unit/unit_sim/unit_sim.c | 449 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 457 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 unit/unit_sim/Makefile
 create mode 100644 unit/unit_sim/unit_sim.c

diff --git a/unit/Makefile b/unit/Makefile
index c181034..267adec 100644
